{"ID":"20240118151306-3v6ckyv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151306-3v6ckyv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151306-3v6ckyv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151306-k9d32og\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122100404-o2h5mlj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129164613-dqufffy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"083薇衔（鹿衔草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240129164613"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151306-k9d32og","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151306-k9d32og","updated":"20240122095008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主风湿痹历节痛，惊痫吐舌，悸气贼风，鼠瘘痈肿。今名鹿衔草。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122095029-uv5dajf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122095029-uv5dajf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西河南，叶似茺蔚。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122095032-a288055","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122095032-a288055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性平无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129164607-9hb34b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129164607-9hb34b2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】鹿衔草主治风湿痹，逐水。益筋节，疗痿躄，婴儿先天不足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129164609-obs38j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129164609-obs38j4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】暴症，逐水。疗痿躄。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129164611-0xm768v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129164611-0xm768v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】妇人服之，绝产无子。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129164612-qaz36ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129164612-qaz36ly"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240129164613-dqufffy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129164613-dqufffy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】待孕之妇忌服，绝产。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122095009-h6b8rgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122095009-h6b8rgm"}},{"ID":"20240122100404-o2h5mlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100404-o2h5mlj","updated":"20240129164538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第83味药，薇衔。这个俗名叫鹿衔草，这个衔也可以有人这样子写。这个鹿呢会含着它，那这个药呢，主要的症状，主要的治病，鼓胀、腹部鼓胀，你脚软弱没有力量，肚子里面有积水，通通可以用它，风湿关节炎都可以用它，在《黄帝内经》里面也提到这个鹿衔草。有个禁忌，如果你要用鹿衔草，用的时候，孕妇的人，想怀孕的人不能用，吃了鹿衔草她不会怀孕了哦，那这个药本身专门治水利关节，风湿关节炎，这样一个禁忌，孕妇要想生小孩的，不是说孕妇哦，待孕，就是准备想怀孕生小孩的不能吃，吃了就不孕了，所以你可以用鹿衔草来避孕，那是可以的。"}]}]}